From {{etyl|ru|ba}} {{term|адрес|lang=ru}}, from {{etyl|fr|ba}} {{term|adresse|lang=fr}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈä.drʲɪs]|lang=ba}}
* {{hyphenation|ад|рес|lang=ba}}

===Noun===
{{ba-noun}}
# [[address]] {{qualifier|direction for letters}}
#: {{usex|Хаттың тышында '''адресын''' күреү менән атайымдың ҡулын таныным.|lang=ba|translation=As soon as I saw the '''address''' on the envelope, I recognized my father's handwriting.}}
